n   core.packedGitLimit=64m and core.packedGitWindowSize=8m, at the SAME cap.\n   No persistent config, disk repair or resource escalation was used.\n   PRESERVATION_WINDOW_RETRY.* then passes:442/442 source-campaign files match\n   exact ed2 Git bytes, removal of only new4 rows recovers exact339 old bytes,\n   manuscript/sidecar/CANON match their initial bytes,46 unrelated untracked\n   entries match initial status metadata. No protected payload bytes were read.\n   The original failed command and all diagnostic streams remain preserved.\n\n6. The banking reviewer disclosed TWO accidental full-audit launches contrary\n   to its no-full-audit dispatch. Both are excluded from every gate. It reports\n   session44982 interrupted with Ctrl-C/exit130, and its earlier direct verifier\n   PID458401 (start03:57:45UTC) stopped by targeted SIGINT at04:03:31.799UTC\n   after identification outside the sandbox's PID-isolated view. Exact launch/\n   termination records and exposure limits remain in the review bundle.\n   No completed result or PASS is inferred, and none replaced the parent's\n   clean audits. This is a procedural failure, not scientific counterevidence.\n   Parent required termination of only the reviewer's own jobs and no repeat.\n\n7. INTEGRATION_CANDIDATE_SHA256SUMS freezes all ten maintained files plus\n   work order, banking record and next-campaign proposal. Assigned code/registry\n   and all thirteen files remain fixed during the clean343-row audit launched\n   after final test pass. Final audit/review/commit disposition follows below.\n\n## Preservation and omitted checks\n\nThe manuscript and coverage sidecar stay at their fixed through-G352/335-row\nedition f23199e4a47aaf83acb9ea7d1ad382cd814159c2. Their byte preservation is\nchecked; no claim that the stock current-registry manuscript verifier passed\non the expanded343-row registry is made. That command's fixed-versus-live\ninput limitation remains, and neither it nor the manuscript was repaired.\nOl